Replace all six instances of `https://grist.org/Indigenous/` in the body with `https://grist.org/indigenous/` (lowercase i), as required by the on-file correction. No prose changes are needed. The six affected inline links are in paragraphs one, two, three, four, six, and seven. The frontmatter reference block already carries the correct form and requires no change.

